{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q27276910","formula":"C₁₀H₂₂Cl₂N₂O₄","hill":"C10H22Cl2N2O4","elements":["H","C","N","O","Cl"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":22.0,"N":2.0,"O":4.0,"Cl":2.0},"names":{"en":"Mannomustine","uk":"Манномустін"},"descriptions":{"en":"Mannomustine (INN), also known as mannitol nitrogen mustard, tradename Degranol is an old alkylating antineoplastic agent from the group of nitrogen mustards. It was first synthesized and characterized in 1957 by Vargha et al. The mechanism of antineoplastic activity of mannomustine, like for all other alkylating agents, lies in its ability to alkylate DNA guanine nucleobases and, thus, to prevent uncoupling of DNA strands, which is a required step for any cell to divide.","ru":"Манномустин (маннитола нитроген мустард, Дегранол) — устаревший цитостатический противоопухолевый химиотерапевтический лекарственный препарат алкилирующего типа действия. Производное бис-β-хлорэтиламина. Манномустин был впервые синтезирован и охарактеризован в 1957 году Vargha с соавторами."},"fame":3,"pubchemCid":3033867,"mass":305.2,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(CCl)NC[C@H]([C@H]([C@@H]([C@@H](CNCCCl)O)O)O)O","inchikey":"MQXVYODZCMMZEM-ZYUZMQFOSA-N","iupac":"(2R,3R,4R,5R)-1,6-bis(2-chloroethylamino)hexane-2,3,4,5-tetrol","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"3033867","atoms":40,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":7.38,"y":-2.045,"z":0.057,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-8.051,"y":-0.712,"z":-0.291,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.846,"y":0.323,"z":1.714,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.851,"y":2.178,"z":0.361,"el":"O"},{"x":2.016,"y":1.703,"z":-1.496,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.336,"y":-1.371,"z":-0.395,"el":"O"},{"x":3.867,"y":-0.109,"z":-0.219,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.056,"y":-0.656,"z":0.17,"el":"N"},{"x":0.883,"y":0.476,"z":0.297,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.528,"y":0.897,"z":-0.177,"el":"C"},{"x":1.974,"y":1